			"Message": "build(Project): Synchronize Element submodule for Electron workbench integration\n\nUpdate Element submodule to coordinate Electron workbench integration across eight Land submodules:\n- Air: Style cleanup, remove obsolete TODOs\n- Common: Update author metadata to CodeEditorLand branding, fix TypeScript rootDir\n- Mountain: Add vscode-file:// protocol handler, update Tauri schema with fs permissions and event IPC\n- Output: Add Electron environment variable for build targeting (Electron/Browser/neither)\n- Rest: Rebuild binary artifact after style standardization\n- Sky: Refactor workbench loading with Effect.runPromise patterns, enable runtime relative imports via _VSCODE_USE_RELATIVE_IMPORTS flag\n- Wind: Add complete INativeWindowConfiguration including appRoot, profiles, product metadata, set VSCODE_DEV=true\n- Worker: Reformat ESBuild configuration indentation\n\nThis resolves the WKWebView (macOS) incompatibility with custom URL schemes and dynamic imports by switching to http://localhost relative imports, enabling the VS Code workbench to render in Tauri's webview.",
